StatRotationEmptyTime [SimTalk] - Turntable
Returns the total time during which the Turntable designated by <Path> was rotating empty, i.e., without
a MU being located on the table.
Type
Read-only Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.StatRotationEmptyTime → time
Return Value
The return value has the data type time.
Example
print MyTurntable.StatRotationEmptyTime
